## Executive Summary

Q4 2024 capped an exceptional year with revenue of $46.3 million, representing 71.5% year-over-year growth and 12.4% sequential growth. We closed our Series D funding of $200M at a $2.4B valuation and achieved GAAP profitability for the first time in company history.

### Key Metrics

| Metric | Q4 2024 | Q3 2024 | Q4 2023 | QoQ Change | YoY Change |
|--------|---------|---------|---------|------------|------------|
| Revenue | $46.3M | $41.2M | $27.0M | +12.4% | +71.5% |
| Gross Profit | $34.3M | $30.6M | $19.7M | +12.1% | +74.1% |
| Gross Margin | 74.1% | 74.3% | 73.0% | -0.2 pts | +1.1 pts |
| Operating Income | $4.6M | $3.5M | ($1.1M) | +31.4% | — |
| Net Income | $1.8M | $1.2M | ($2.5M) | +50.0% | — |
| ARR (end of period) | $168.2M | $162.5M | $95.8M | +3.5% | +75.6% |
| Total Customers | 589 | 558 | 412 | +5.6% | +43.0% |

